        "original_id": "47454c89-2349-57da-bd72-00572283af8e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thilo Rothkirch, Matthias Lechner, Andrea Romano\n- Films: Laura's Star, Wonder Woman (2009 film), I'm a Fish, Escape from Planet Earth\n- Roles: producer, director, casting director, voice director, voice actress\n\nFacts:\n- Laura's Star is a 2004 German animated feature film.\n- Thilo Rothkirch produced and directed Laura's Star.\n- Wonder Woman is a 2009 direct-to-DVD animated superhero film about the superheroine Wonder Woman.\n- Matthias Lechner worked on I'm a Fish, Escape from Planet Earth, and Laura's Star.\n- Andrea Romano, born on December 3, 1955, is an American casting director, voice director, and voice actress.\n- Andrea Romano's work includes Tiny Toon Adventures, Animaniacs, Freakazoid, Pinky and the Brain, Teen Titans, The Legend of Korra, Static Shock, Justice League, Justice League Unlimited, Batman Beyond, Phineas and Ferb, and Warner Bros. Animation/DC Comics direct-to-video films including Wonder Woman.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
